        rdfs:comment                   "Square shawl of woven silk and wool, possibly made in Austria, ca. 1825-1835"@en , "Square shawl of woven silk and wool. Woven with a narrow border of small floral motifs and a wide border of large floral motifs. The ground is covered with sprigs of flowers in red, pink, blue, green and yellow on a white ground. Fringes on two sides."@en ;
